      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay thanks. i was kinda worried though bc i looked up fruit breath online and it said something about diabetic ketoacidosis? which sounds pretty scary. i'm also starting to feel a little bit dizzy and my stomach hurts quite a bit. do u think i should go to the urgent care just to be safe or is it really just a bug?",
